note: The Math library unlocks fractions, decimals, percentages,
note: square roots, powers and division.
library "Math" add

display 1 divided by 2 as fraction
display 1 divided by 2 as decimal
display 1 divided by 3 as fraction
say 50 percent of 200
say square root of 16
say 2 power of 3
say 1 plus 1
say "1 plus 1"
